# Upper bound is deliberate. SQLAlchemy 2.1 renamed
# `orm.attributes.ScalarAttributeImpl` to `_ScalarAttributeImpl`, which breaks
# sqlalchemy-utils 0.42.1 (latest) at import time. sqlalchemy-utils is a test
# dependency, but tests must run against the same SQLAlchemy as production, so
# the bound lives here. Remove it once sqlalchemy-utils supports 2.1, or once
# `src/async_database_utils.py` stops depending on sqlalchemy-utils internals.
